{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26867","headline":"题山寺 · 姚合","name":"题山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千重山崦里，楼阁影参差。\n未暇寻僧院，先看置寺碑。\n竹深行渐暗，石稳坐多时。\n古塔虫蛇善，阴廊鸟雀痴。\n云开上界近，泉落下方迟。\n爲爱青桐叶，因题满树诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26867.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26867","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}